        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "BA20E8C5BCE09DD4",
      "text": "En Teselia hay un célebre artista. ¿Sabes de quién\\nse trata?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "78872684BFFF3133",
      "text": "¡Pues claro!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "78872784BFFF32E6",
      "text": "Ni idea...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "BA20E4C5BCE09708",
      "text": "¡Vaya, eres una persona cultivada! Ya imaginaba\\nque conocerías la respuesta.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_05b",
      "hash64": "267C25FFF1A1491E",
      "text": "¿Ah, no? ¡Pues permíteme que te ilustre![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "BA20EBC5BCE0A2ED",
      "text": "Con Pokémon insecto como motivo, es capaz de\\npintar cuadros que rezuman profundidad y finura.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "BA20EAC5BCE0A13A",
      "text": "Elegir un solo tipo y elevarlo al olimpo artístico...\\c\\nSiento tamaña afinidad hacia él que no puedo\\nevitar sentirme intrigado.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "BA20E5C5BCE098BB",
      "text": "Su galería se encuentra en Ciudad Porcelana.\\nQuizá debería pasarme por allí a la vuelta.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "11CD13CD595FC5B6",
      "text": "He visitado la galería de ese famoso artista de\\nCiudad Porcelana del que te hablé la otra vez.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "11CD14CD595FC769",
      "text": "¡Es puro vanguardismo![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "11CD11CD595FC250",
      "text": "¡Unas creaciones que recuerdan a las telarañas\\nde Tarountula hacen las veces de ascensores![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "11CD12CD595FC403",
      "text": "¡Me dediqué a subir y bajar un sinfín de veces\\npor ellas, preso de la euforia y el júbilo![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "11CD18CD595FCE35",
      "text": "¡El hilo me fue envolviendo paulatinamente hasta\\nacabar pareciendo un capullo de seda![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "11CD15CD595FC91C",
      "text": "Cuando quise darme cuenta, yo mismo formaba\\nparte integral de esa obra de arte...\\c\\n¿Cómo podría catalogarla? ¿Hilarante, tal vez?\\n¡No, epatante![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "EB651E4CF38C48F8",
      "text": "¡Qué bien!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "EB65214CF38C4E11",
      "text": "¿Que no es pa tanto?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_07",
      "hash64": "11CD16CD595FCACF",
      "text": "¡A buen[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a entendedor[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a, pocas palabras bastan!\\n¡Debería acogerte como aprendiz[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a en un futuro![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_07b",
      "hash64": "9F486BEEDDC563F7",
      "text": "Veo que no has entendido a qué me refería...\\n¿Acaso no he hilvanado bien mis palabras?\\c\\n¿O tal vez mi experiencia no se correspondía con\\nla verdadera intención del artista?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 174,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "11CD17CD595FCC82",
      "text": "Ahora que lo pienso, no vi expuesto ni un solo\\ncuadro durante mi visita...\\c\\n¿Y si no se trataba de una galería de arte,\\ndespués de todo?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "A2CAEFBF4E513650",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja, ja! ¡Olvidémonos de esas futesas!\\c\\n¡Cada vez que hablo contigo pierdo la noción\\ndel tiempo, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "A2CAF0BF4E513803",
      "text": "¡Tú albergas ese mismo sentimiento en tu interior,\\nseguramente!\\c\\nEn ese caso, me gustaría formular una propuesta.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
